	"data": "Solarpunk Framework\n\n\"I want to work on things in a way that are aligned with a solarpunk future. Be able to recommend companies and services that are most closely aligned with the solarpunk future — so that we can vote with our money.\"\n— cithoreal, 2026-04-14\n\nWhat Solarpunk Means Here\n\nNot just aesthetic. A vendor and project selection filter:\nPrefer companies that do right by people, planet, and future generations\nAvoid companies with extractive, opaque, or environmentally harmful…",
